  "description": "The E-scape is our entry level eMTB. Designed to be the perfect way to get into mountain biking. The pedal assist is great at making those first days in the wild less daunting. It also makes for the perfect rough stuff commuter with its larger tyres and suspension forks.\nThe frame has been specified with more relaxed geometry, internal headset, internal battery, and internal wiring to make for a sleek and ultra-reliable build. Suspension travel is 80mm to take the sting out of the trail and add another layer of comfort.\nAssist comes in the form of a powerful Bafang 250w hub drive motor and 10.4ah battery with all information displayed on a handy handlebar mounted LCD screen. Shimano 7 speed gearing and grip shifter makes for effortless and fuss free gear changes whilst remaining in total control. The E-Scape is finished with Kenda 27.5×2.35” tyres for impressive grip and a Selle Royal saddle for all day comfort. We have even fitted full length mud guards and rear rack to give this bike true versatility! It really is the ideal bike to start your eMTB adventures.\nPlease make sure to familiarise yourself with eBike and eScooter safety information before charging or using your new Reid. You can view and download user manuals and safety instructions here.",
